{
  "id": "622",
  "title": "Can I Park Here?",
  "level": "newbie",
  "date": "2018-12-27",
  "synopsis": "Little He is stopped by the guard when he tries to drive into the school campus.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/923/b1c2faefa597980381bf048930581de3b073ebff.mp3?1698350347",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "这里可以停车吗？\n\n门卫：唉唉唉，这里是学校，你不能开车进去。\n小何：啊，不好意思。那这里可以停车吗？\n门卫：这里不能停车。\n小何：那哪里可以停车？\n门卫：那边有个停车场，那边可以停车。",
    "traditional": "這裡可以停車嗎？\n\n門衛：唉唉唉，這裡是學校，你不能開車進去。\n小何：啊，不好意思。那這裡可以停車嗎？\n門衛：這裡不能停車。\n小何：那哪裏可以停車？\n門衛：那邊有個停車場，那邊可以停車。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Can I park here?"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "门卫：唉唉唉，这里是学校，你不能开车进去。",
      "traditional": "門衛：唉唉唉，這裡是學校，你不能開車進去。",
      "pinyin": "mén wèi ài ài ài zhè lǐ shì xué xiào nǐ bù néng kāi chē jìn qù",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Guard: No no no, this is a school. You cannot drive in here."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "小何：啊，不好意思。那这里可以停车吗？",
      "traditional": "小何：啊，不好意思。那這裡可以停車嗎？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo hé a bù hǎo yì si nà zhè lǐ kě yǐ tíng chē ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little He: Ah, I’m sorry. Can I park here then?"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "门卫：这里不能停车。",
      "traditional": "門衛：這裡不能停車。",
      "pinyin": "mén wèi zhè lǐ bù néng tíng chē",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Guard: You can’t park here."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "小何：那哪里可以停车？",
      "traditional": "小何：那哪裏可以停車？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo hé nà nǎ lǐ kě yǐ tíng chē",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little He: Then, where can I park?"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "门卫：那边有个停车场，那边可以停车。",
      "traditional": "門衛：那邊有個停車場，那邊可以停車。",
      "pinyin": "mén wèi nà bian yǒu ge tíng chē chǎng nà bian kě yǐ tíng chē",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Guard: There is a parking lot over there. You can park there."
    }
  ],
